                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Saurabh Tandan &amp;lt;saurabh.tandan@intel.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please provide additional information about the failure here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/a04a8de4-3a7b-11e6-a0ce-5254006e85c2" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/a04a8de4-3a7b-11e6-a0ce-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;sanity-sec failing with following error message:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;CMD: trevis-48vm3 /usr/sbin/lctl nodemap_modify --property squash_uid --name default --value 99
trevis-48vm3: error: invalid ioctl: 000ce051 errno: 2 with rc=-1
trevis-48vm3: error: nodemap_modify: cannot modify nodemap 'default' to param 'squash_uid': value '99': rc = -1
test-framework exiting on error
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
